  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After Fang An Lei is struck, orange profound light from Chicken Dog Coop enters her forehead and eases the purple miasma. Fang Yun and Fang Leng greet him as third supreme elder. Fang Yuan recalls intel on him while he chides Fang Chen for slandering their ally Suan Bu Jin.",
      "chapters": [
        1519
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_an_lei",
        "house_chicken_dog_coop",
        "char_fang_yun",
        "char_fang_leng",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_fang_chen"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Narration calls him a sly old fox and notes his old face twitching during hard talks.",
      "chapters": [
        1520
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He bargains compensation with Fang Yuan inside Fallen Flower Hall, then leaves for Chicken Dog Coop when the demands pass his bottom line and reports the failed negotiation to Fang Di Chang in Inquiry Dock.",
      "chapters": [
        1520
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "negotiation-and-command",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_fallen_flower_hall",
        "char_fang_di_chang",
        "house_inquiry_dock"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With Fang Di Chang he is named a strong expert famous in Western Desert among Fang clan’s force in green ghost desert.",
      "chapters": [
        1521
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "negotiation-and-command",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_western_desert",
        "fac_fang_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is the person in charge when six Fang clan Gu Immortals face Divine Bean Palace’s side.",
      "chapters": [
        1522
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "negotiation-and-command",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "house_divine_bean_palace"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He later feels envy at Fang Yuan’s gains and leads Fang clan attacks again after Chen Yi shows rank eight strength.",
      "chapters": [
        1525
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
